{
 "_doc": [
  "One entry per request shape. server: fl2va (D23) | ref2va (C12). task: t2va | fl2va | ref2va",
  "selects the endpoint. expect: ok (202 + playable mp4) | reject (4xx at admission) | probe",
  "(record whatever happens; an accepted probe is polled to completion like a normal job).",
  "prompt/negative_prompt name files in assets/prompts; images/videos/audios name files in assets.",
  "frame_pos (fl2va) defaults to [0] or [0,-1]. extra is merged over the payload last; inside it",
  "a string '@asset:NAME' is replaced by that file's base64. weight>0 puts the case in the",
  "sustained-load rotation; tags: core = baseline + recovery, edge = run last (risky shapes),",
  "det = run twice back to back to check seed determinism."
 ],
